      "writtenOn": "2020-11-16T22:55:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why do we want to keep extra references here instead of getting them from phone object each time? it creates extra complication and the array needs re-sized upon single sim \u003c-\u003e dual sim config change. so i don\u0027t think this is necessary.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 303,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 309,
        "endChar": 47
