      "lineNbr": 309,
      "author": {
        "id": 1040179
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T10:53:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of getting call objects from phone whenever there is a call, its better to store all the call objects during power up. In case of back to back calls, it will add overhead to read call object always from phone. \n\nAs these are dynamic arrays and initialized in constructor based on activemodemcount, there should not be any issue when switching between single and dual sim config change.",
      "parentUuid": "e17f0353_acfadaa4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 303,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 309,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "0315b2df07edc86652686ca83a4f6af794f867ad",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
