      "message": "mActiveModemCount will change upon ss\u003c-\u003edsds switch, so you will end up with array of wrong size and lead to crashes.\nthe \"overhead\" you mentioned are really light-weighted calls. they also simply get array addresses simply from a different classes, yet it\u0027s very error prone. that\u0027s definitely not an optimization worth doing.",
