      "writtenOn": "2020-11-16T22:55:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This API should simply reflect if it\u0027s in voice call, not mixed with other logic like this. i don\u0027t follow why dataDuringCallsEnabled is affecting anything here. Please move this logic to a proper place, and explain in both the CL commit message and above this code how dataDuringCallsEnabled case should be handled differently.",
