      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T10:53:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"Data during calls\" UI option will allow default pdn setup on non DDS sub when mobile data is off. Without this option, default pdn cannot be setup on non DDS sub when there is a call. There will be no use of DDS switch if default pdn cannot be setup during call (no data switch).\nHence added a dependency on the UI option \"Data during calls\" so that DDS switch can be allowed during calls only if this option is set",
      "parentUuid": "47eaec9a_46bb3ddd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1539,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1547,
        "endChar": 9
      },
